      "en": "His splendor is like the sunrise. Rays shine from his hand, where his power is hidden.",
      "ko": "그 광명이 햇빛 같고 광선이 그 손에서 나오니 그 권능이 그 속에 감취었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "82fa4b047e6731b84d71c6cc668e11ec7329e7a60e9c1a41525ea1667d8008ff",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e98ce0816e353a745d2b3c35993f40b814db1110a0b026dcc2ef924dc869e22",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
